msgstr "Vissa spel kan inte startas eller har problem med inmatningen"

#: dashboard/qml/TroubleshootPage.qml:62
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"For game specific issues, check on <a "
"href=\"https://db.vronlinux.org/\">vronlinux DB</a> if there are known bugs "
